{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>A plague</b> — HaShem will bring plagues upon him, as in the matter: \"And HaShem plagued Pharaoh\" (Genesis 12:17)." "<b>And disgrace</b> — that he will be despised in the eyes of all who see him." "<b>And his shame</b> — in lying with another man's wife." "<b>It shall not be wiped away</b> — on account of people."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:15.641056455Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}